# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the tools (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=cli/lsan.supp).
# ThorVG keeps a memory pool per thread that rendered, until the engine terminates, and frees
# them only when no canvas is left. threadtest starts new threads every round, so their pools
# are left at exit. The players render on a fixed set of threads: this does not grow there.
leak:mpoolReq
